<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "sign a chair's view of a face's head with its seat key"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.chair.views", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.chair.views"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.chair.views"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.chair.views ~ a chair speaks for the head it sees

`lares persona view <persona-…> --seat-key <64 hex>` signs a Kahu chair's view of a face's head with the seat key it holds here, printing the view line a restore confirms by.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ view

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`view` params=`prefix/persona-<hex> seat-key/<hex> ~ sign a chair's view of one face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ prefix · seat-key

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`prefix` params=`takes/prefix needs/required seat/1 as/<persona-…> ~ the face, persona-<64 hex>`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`seat-key` params=`takes/hex needs/required ~ the chair it speaks as, 64 hex`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ signs with a seat key sealed on this vessel`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.chair.views prefix/persona-<hex> seat-key/<hex>]] ~ the prefix or the seat key reads malformed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ viewed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`viewed` params=`exit/0 ~ the view line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares persona view

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares persona view]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

